WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.580 --> 01:43.180
[Eve of Li Changshou's Tribulation]

01:43.920 --> 01:45.330
So many clouds up here.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.660
That is...

01:53.400 --> 01:54.130
Changgeng?

01:55.120 --> 01:56.660
No wonder Fate didn't strike me down.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.130
He's a ruthless one.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.180
Bear with it a moment.

02:12.750 --> 02:13.780
The Pregenesis Sword.

02:22.460 --> 02:25.420
[Episode 16]

02:30.680 --> 02:32.220
This Tribulation bearer

02:33.080 --> 02:34.940
looks like Changgeng.

02:35.840 --> 02:37.450
Changgeng is but a mask.

02:38.630 --> 02:40.940
No wonder we couldn't find him.

02:42.430 --> 02:44.260
Did you see his face?

02:44.560 --> 02:46.130
That was the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.100
I couldn't get anywhere near it.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.340
But I saw Changgeng

02:48.400 --> 02:50.060
take out the Pregenesis Sword.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.780
After he left Bear Island,

02:51.960 --> 02:53.260
he went straight into the Tribulation.

02:54.150 --> 02:55.780
So, he must've gotten
the magic instrument.

02:56.590 --> 02:58.260
That's why his power surged.

02:58.680 --> 02:59.690
Now that he's survived the Tribulation,

02:59.960 --> 03:01.130
his power must've grown enormously.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.380
If we don't deal with him now,

03:02.470 --> 03:03.170
sooner or later,

03:03.190 --> 03:05.540
he'll be a grave threat
to the Westdawn Sect.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.850
More importantly,

03:07.800 --> 03:10.570
we must take the Pregenesis Sword
from him.

03:12.240 --> 03:14.730
The Westdawn Sect's plan
spans a thousand years.

03:14.910 --> 03:17.980
The Two Saints await us
to open the East Sea's Eye.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.540
Easier said than done.

03:21.120 --> 03:22.850
Where can we find his true form?

03:27.630 --> 03:29.380
Changgeng first appeared

03:29.630 --> 03:31.260
in the Dragon Palace of the East Sea.

03:31.800 --> 03:34.380
There was only one route in and out.

03:34.960 --> 03:35.940
That means

03:36.590 --> 03:38.060
Changgeng's true form

03:38.360 --> 03:40.980
was among those in the palace then.

03:41.800 --> 03:43.540
If he's not from the Dragon Clan,

03:43.590 --> 03:45.730
he must be from the Ascendance Sect.

03:46.120 --> 03:48.220
Changgeng is a fearsome foe,

03:48.240 --> 03:49.940
but he has things he fears.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.690
He used this mask

03:52.750 --> 03:54.940
to keep us from finding his true form.

03:55.800 --> 03:56.570
Then,

03:57.750 --> 03:59.500
there must be a reason.

03:59.710 --> 04:01.980
We'll expose what he fears

04:03.120 --> 04:04.660
and force a flaw to show.

04:05.430 --> 04:06.290
How do you plan to do that?

04:07.750 --> 04:08.540
Lord Bian,

04:10.310 --> 04:12.540
you might reveal his mask

04:13.870 --> 04:15.100
and tell everyone

04:15.150 --> 04:17.580
that the cultivator who survived

04:18.510 --> 04:19.930
the Divine-Demon Tribulation
is Changgeng.

04:23.270 --> 04:23.900
What do you mean?

04:27.790 --> 04:28.650
Next,

04:30.800 --> 04:33.980
point Changgeng's identity
toward the Ascendance Sect.

04:36.110 --> 04:37.140
Wen Jing,

04:38.160 --> 04:39.900
you asked me for a plan.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.460
It's time to set it in motion.

04:45.320 --> 04:47.300
Are you sure?

04:47.520 --> 04:49.370
The Westdawn Sect's thousand-year plan

04:50.120 --> 04:51.570
is just one step away.

04:54.240 --> 04:56.370
We must find Changgeng

04:56.510 --> 04:57.900
and seize the Pregenesis Sword,

04:58.630 --> 05:00.660
no matter the cost.

05:04.740 --> 05:08.340
[Anshui City, Donglin Kingdom]

05:08.390 --> 05:10.140
The Sea Deity

05:10.310 --> 05:11.850
can grant great power!

05:12.430 --> 05:13.660
If you want it,

05:14.120 --> 05:16.780
come and find Xiong Lingli.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.490
The Sea Deity

05:18.510 --> 05:19.780
can grant great power!

05:19.870 --> 05:20.980
If you want it,

05:21.000 --> 05:22.580
come and find Xiong Lingli.

05:22.600 --> 05:23.610
Take a look at the Sea Deity Sect.

05:23.630 --> 05:24.490
The Sea Deity Sect.

05:25.630 --> 05:27.340
Come and find Xiong Lingli.

05:27.360 --> 05:29.370
The Sea Deity can grant great power!

05:29.390 --> 05:32.610
If you want it,
come and find Xiong Lingli.

05:37.780 --> 05:39.060
[The Sea Deity can grant great power]

05:41.160 --> 05:42.930
Sir, do you want in?

05:43.070 --> 05:44.020
The Sea Deity Sect?

05:44.360 --> 05:45.850
The Sea Deity can grant great power!

05:46.750 --> 05:48.050
Bro, join us.

05:49.600 --> 05:52.540
Our Grandlord Changgeng

05:52.560 --> 05:53.930
is a true deity.

05:53.950 --> 05:54.730
Changgeng?

05:55.390 --> 05:56.460
Could it be the Changgeng

05:56.480 --> 05:58.290
who faced Tribulation in the South Sea?

05:58.600 --> 06:00.540
You know our deity?

06:01.120 --> 06:03.580
A deity's Tribulation is rare.

06:03.600 --> 06:05.540
Word has spread these days.

06:05.560 --> 06:07.660
I heard that Changgeng

06:07.950 --> 06:10.020
is a Qi refiner from Ascendance Sect.

06:11.270 --> 06:12.930
Do you know the way to Ascendance Sect?

06:13.560 --> 06:15.250
It's in the Divine Land.

06:16.870 --> 06:18.020
Everyone, follow me.

06:18.510 --> 06:19.780
Everyone, hurry, follow me!

06:19.800 --> 06:21.170
I've found the deity!

06:21.190 --> 06:21.700
The Sea Deity...

06:21.720 --> 06:22.700
Deity, I'm coming!

06:22.720 --> 06:23.780
can grant great power!

06:23.800 --> 06:24.730
Deity!

06:24.750 --> 06:25.490
The Sea Deity...

06:25.510 --> 06:26.490
Deity, I'm coming!

06:26.510 --> 06:27.540
can grant great power!

06:27.560 --> 06:28.780
Deity!

06:36.300 --> 06:39.540
[Good Luck, Certain Victory]

06:43.600 --> 06:46.260
This Tribulation is too showy.

06:46.670 --> 06:49.050
It will surely spark new karma

06:49.560 --> 06:51.700
and bring even more calamity.

06:52.320 --> 06:54.810
I must account for every change.

06:56.320 --> 06:57.330
With your skill,

06:57.350 --> 06:58.570
why hide yourself away?

06:58.830 --> 07:00.100
You could show your talent

07:00.190 --> 07:02.060
and make your name among cultivators.

07:02.350 --> 07:03.740
That will not do.

07:04.600 --> 07:06.060
The Great Tribulation

07:06.080 --> 07:07.370
is almost upon us.

07:07.390 --> 07:10.220
I cannot be noticed now.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.450
The Westdawn Sect is after me.

07:16.840 --> 07:18.500
My paper butterflies found

07:18.520 --> 07:19.540
that someone has spread rumors,

07:19.960 --> 07:22.050
claiming Changgeng caused
this Tribulation,

07:22.350 --> 07:23.300
and that Changgeng

07:23.560 --> 07:25.140
is hiding in Ascendance Sect.

07:25.430 --> 07:26.010
Good.

07:26.640 --> 07:27.260
Good?

07:27.750 --> 07:29.220
How is that good?

07:30.470 --> 07:31.650
Back on Bear Island,

07:32.070 --> 07:33.540
you helped me plan.

07:34.350 --> 07:35.540
Now, it's my turn.

07:40.390 --> 07:42.140
Yunxiao, any plan?

07:42.390 --> 07:43.540
It's quite simple.

07:43.560 --> 07:46.050
You only need to admit
that you're Changgeng.

07:47.550 --> 07:48.890
Westdawn Sect hides in the dark.

07:49.000 --> 07:50.060
If we can't catch them,

07:50.080 --> 07:51.730
we'll stay on the back foot.

07:52.110 --> 07:53.500
Now, they have recognized you.

07:53.520 --> 07:54.780
Just claim your identity.

07:54.800 --> 07:56.300
That will bring them out.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.340
Rest assured.

07:57.520 --> 07:58.450
With my help,

07:58.470 --> 07:59.730
I will keep you safe.

08:00.160 --> 08:02.140
Once we catch a Westdawn Sect man,

08:02.160 --> 08:03.500
we can trace the clue

08:03.550 --> 08:04.730
and bring down Westdawn Sect.

08:04.750 --> 08:06.730
Then we can stop the Great Tribulation.

08:06.960 --> 08:07.730
Yunxiao.

08:08.030 --> 08:08.810
Well.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.860
Have you misunderstood me?

08:11.630 --> 08:12.370
What?

08:12.390 --> 08:14.730
I can't claim that identity.

08:15.080 --> 08:15.650
You...

08:15.880 --> 08:17.090
I've arranged
the Dragon Clan's ascension plan

08:17.110 --> 08:19.140
for the Celestial Court.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.010
But I accidentally

08:20.030 --> 08:22.810
stripped Ao Yi
of all his spiritual energy.

08:22.880 --> 08:24.780
So, I must help him regain his strength

08:24.800 --> 08:25.730
and return to the Dragon Palace,

08:25.750 --> 08:27.650
so I can finish the ascension plan.

08:27.670 --> 08:28.780
What about the Westdawn Sect?

08:28.800 --> 08:30.500
They're triggering
the Great Tribulation,

08:30.520 --> 08:32.610
yet you're focused
on your ascension plan.

08:32.960 --> 08:34.300
Right now,

08:34.360 --> 08:37.090
the best outcome is letting
the Celestial Court

08:37.110 --> 08:38.730
step into Dragon Palace affairs.

08:39.360 --> 08:41.250
Yunxiao, don't be so hasty.

08:42.520 --> 08:43.890
I am being hasty.

08:44.110 --> 08:45.500
You leave nothing to chance.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.010
Yunxiao.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.340
Yunxiao.

08:50.110 --> 08:51.420
We still do not know

08:51.440 --> 08:52.330
how far Westdawn Sect has spread.

08:52.350 --> 08:53.730
So we cannot act rashly.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.770
Did you not say they've infiltrated

08:54.790 --> 08:56.140
the Ascendance Sect?

08:56.160 --> 08:57.930
Let's just start with Ascendance Sect

08:57.950 --> 09:00.260
and root out Westdawn Sect entirely.

09:00.280 --> 09:01.980
You make it sound so easy.

09:02.000 --> 09:02.330
But...

09:02.350 --> 09:03.210
You are unwilling?

09:04.600 --> 09:06.140
It is not that.

09:07.350 --> 09:08.260
This matter

09:08.560 --> 09:10.100
needs a longer plan

09:10.160 --> 09:11.420
and full preparation, right?

09:13.400 --> 09:14.580
Then, you can

09:15.120 --> 09:16.050
take your time preparing.

09:18.280 --> 09:18.930
Yunxiao.

09:19.510 --> 09:19.860
I...

09:20.880 --> 09:21.660
Yunxiao.

09:27.120 --> 09:27.940
It's been so long.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.850
Senior surely misses me.

09:31.870 --> 09:33.650
This time, I'll win him over.

09:36.150 --> 09:36.700
Don't go.

09:38.720 --> 09:39.250
What?

09:39.510 --> 09:40.420
Don't go.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.730
He's talking about me.

09:46.550 --> 09:48.130
Yunxiao, don't go.

09:49.550 --> 09:51.490
Don't go, Yunxiao.

10:07.670 --> 10:08.730
Mentor.

10:09.080 --> 10:10.650
Wait. What are you two doing here?

10:10.910 --> 10:12.180
What do you mean?

10:13.030 --> 10:14.650
You trapped me here for so long

10:14.750 --> 10:16.530
and came back with no apology.

10:16.550 --> 10:17.530
You just hid here to nap.

10:18.080 --> 10:20.340
Junior already came to save you.

10:25.150 --> 10:26.060
Junior?

10:26.080 --> 10:27.730
You told her you were visiting kin.

10:28.910 --> 10:29.770
Visiting kin?

10:30.550 --> 10:31.700
What relatives do you have?

10:31.720 --> 10:33.700
Goat relatives in the mountains?

10:33.790 --> 10:35.530
Or monkey relatives?

10:36.270 --> 10:37.340
Mentor, you've misunderstood.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.370
Alright, stop making things up.

10:38.390 --> 10:39.530
I won't believe a word of it.

10:40.550 --> 10:41.850
I can't be bothered to spin tales.

11:00.510 --> 11:01.700
You're lovesick, aren't you?

11:02.840 --> 11:03.940
Mentor, what are you talking about?

11:05.270 --> 11:06.650
Don't explain. You're young.

11:06.670 --> 11:08.060
I know all too well.

11:08.080 --> 11:10.530
I just fear you'll make a mistake.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.420
Haven't you blundered enough before?

11:17.510 --> 11:18.300
No, Mentor.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.370
No, don't, please don't.

11:19.390 --> 11:20.490
Don't pick up the whip.

11:41.910 --> 11:42.610
Flowers

11:43.840 --> 11:45.340
can bloom again,

11:46.080 --> 11:46.850
but youth

11:48.910 --> 11:50.300
never returns.

11:51.720 --> 11:53.490
Cherish those around you.

11:55.320 --> 11:56.100
Actually,

11:58.750 --> 12:00.340
I also once had

12:02.360 --> 12:04.010
an unforgettable love.

12:05.750 --> 12:07.250
It wasn't in spring.

12:09.320 --> 12:10.650
It was in late autumn.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.010
She and I...

12:15.870 --> 12:16.460
Changshou!

12:17.960 --> 12:18.490
Changshou!

12:20.910 --> 12:21.490
Changshou!

12:23.910 --> 12:25.490
The mood is at its peak.

12:25.510 --> 12:27.100
Let me finish!

12:45.670 --> 12:46.420
It was

12:48.360 --> 12:50.100
in late autumn.

12:53.980 --> 12:55.580
[Hall of United Spirits]

12:57.510 --> 12:58.530
Disciple...

13:02.960 --> 13:03.850
Mentor,

13:03.870 --> 13:04.890
I'm Qi Yuan.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.850
Today, I vow to make
Ascendance Sect my home.

13:06.910 --> 13:08.060
I will cultivate the Way

13:08.630 --> 13:09.610
[Wan Jiangyu]
and guard here forever.

13:10.360 --> 13:11.490
Good, good.

13:11.750 --> 13:12.850
I'm Wan Jiangyu.

13:12.870 --> 13:14.530
I'll also make Ascendance Sect my home.

13:14.550 --> 13:16.820
I will cultivate the Way
and guard here forever.

14:40.820 --> 14:44.860
[Jade Division]

14:49.960 --> 14:50.730
What is this?

14:51.270 --> 14:52.940
Tomorrow, you'll go
to the Training Assembly.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.250
Your cultivation is still shallow.

14:54.270 --> 14:55.610
You may not beat those beasts.

14:55.630 --> 14:57.060
So, I made this amulet.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.130
It's the Training Assembly.

15:03.750 --> 15:04.980
Mentor sent us to train there.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.300
How can you help me?

15:06.320 --> 15:08.100
Even if I win, it would be unseemly.

15:08.480 --> 15:09.340
I do not want it.

15:10.510 --> 15:11.530
How can you do that?

15:14.550 --> 15:15.770
How can you do that?

15:20.870 --> 15:21.730
Do not worry.

15:23.960 --> 15:25.060
I will win for sure.

15:26.150 --> 15:27.300
You fool.

15:28.360 --> 15:29.100
Come on, come on.

15:33.600 --> 15:34.370
Senior!

15:35.480 --> 15:38.100
I'll win this time.

15:40.260 --> 15:42.510
[Tablets of past Ascendance Grandlords]

15:42.510 --> 15:45.060
May Junior Qi Yuan do us proud

15:45.320 --> 15:46.460
and pass the Training Assembly.

15:47.150 --> 15:48.820
Senior.

15:50.510 --> 15:52.130
Qi Yuan! Qi Yuan!

15:52.510 --> 15:53.300
Senior!

15:53.670 --> 15:54.460
Qi Yuan!

15:55.200 --> 15:55.940
What happened?

15:55.960 --> 15:56.850
Wasn't he at the Training Assembly?

15:56.870 --> 15:57.650
How was he injured?

15:57.670 --> 16:00.060
He had an accident there.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.770
His foundation is ruined.

16:01.790 --> 16:04.850
He has no hope of ascending
to immortality.

16:06.630 --> 16:07.420
Qi Yuan.

16:08.150 --> 16:08.940
Senior,

16:11.550 --> 16:13.340
I let you down.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.700
I let you down.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.460
Senior.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.850
Junior Qi Yuan.

16:40.030 --> 16:41.130
After we part today,

16:41.320 --> 16:42.940
we may never meet again?

16:43.910 --> 16:45.250
You are gifted,

16:45.360 --> 16:46.730
a first-rate immortal seedling.

16:47.360 --> 16:49.370
I once hoped to cultivate and ascend

16:49.790 --> 16:51.130
to immortality with you,

16:54.200 --> 16:56.100
but now your foundation is ruined.

16:57.030 --> 16:58.220
That's made you an ordinary man.

16:59.030 --> 16:59.650
I...

17:01.630 --> 17:02.770
How could I bear such a thing?

17:06.000 --> 17:07.940
Mentor and I have decided to leave

17:07.960 --> 17:08.900
and search the world

17:09.750 --> 17:11.900
for herbs to mend your foundation.

17:16.640 --> 17:17.420
Qi Yuan,

17:18.790 --> 17:19.770
wait for me.

17:21.200 --> 17:22.570
I'll cure you.

17:29.920 --> 17:30.700
Senior!

17:30.700 --> 17:32.440
[Jade Division]

17:32.440 --> 17:33.220
Senior!

17:36.350 --> 17:37.700
Senior!

17:45.720 --> 17:46.490
Senior.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.180
Senior.

17:52.880 --> 17:53.660
Senior.

18:00.920 --> 18:01.700
Senior.

18:04.680 --> 18:05.770
Senior.

18:57.240 --> 18:57.900
Speak.

19:00.350 --> 19:01.420
I've figured it out.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.660
Although this Tribulation is too showy,

19:03.680 --> 19:04.980
the outside world doesn't know

19:05.000 --> 19:07.620
the true Tribulation bearer is me.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.420
But I know.

19:09.440 --> 19:10.810
Except for you.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.490
In that case,

19:12.960 --> 19:15.940
I just need to steer this a bit

19:16.240 --> 19:18.810
and direct
the bearer's identity elsewhere.

19:18.830 --> 19:21.050
That'll give me some room to maneuver.

19:21.070 --> 19:21.810
How about it?

19:22.030 --> 19:22.900
Who should you direct it to?

19:25.030 --> 19:26.220
This person

19:26.590 --> 19:28.420
must stay far from me.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.700
They can't be from Ascendance Sect.

19:32.480 --> 19:34.090
How about...

19:36.160 --> 19:38.220
How about I say
it's an Elucidating Sect immortal

19:38.240 --> 19:40.090
out for the Tribulation?

19:41.240 --> 19:42.010
Senior!

19:44.960 --> 19:45.730
Senior!

19:49.000 --> 19:50.010
What is it, Junior?

19:50.030 --> 19:50.770
Senior!

19:53.480 --> 19:54.220
Senior!

19:54.240 --> 19:56.250
Cloudlink Hermit
from the Elucidating Sect is here.

19:56.270 --> 19:57.530
Mentor wants to see you.

19:57.880 --> 19:58.770
The Elucidating Sect?

20:02.830 --> 20:04.180
When the Three Sages attained the Way,

20:04.590 --> 20:07.380
the Primeval Lord of Heaven
founded the Elucidating Sect.

20:07.830 --> 20:08.770
That sect

20:08.790 --> 20:10.250
is very strict in taking disciples.

20:10.270 --> 20:12.770
Only those truly blessed may enter.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.220
Don't let the small number fool you.

20:14.640 --> 20:16.420
They have Empyreal Aureate Immortals.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.180
How are they so powerful?

20:19.240 --> 20:21.810
They hand-pick immortal seedlings
as disciples

20:22.270 --> 20:24.810
and then feed them spirit elixirs

20:24.830 --> 20:26.090
and treasure pearls.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.220
And then...

20:27.550 --> 20:28.330
So...

20:29.440 --> 20:30.700
That's basically cheating.

20:33.960 --> 20:34.770
The Grandlord has arrived.

20:35.000 --> 20:37.460
Greetings, Grandlord.

20:39.960 --> 20:40.730
Sir,

20:41.750 --> 20:43.420
forgive me
for not greeting you sooner.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.730
I'm Cloudlink Hermit of Jadevoid Palace.

20:45.730 --> 20:46.670
[Cloudlink Hermit, Elucidating Sect]

20:46.670 --> 20:48.220
Nice to see you.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.490
What brings you

20:51.550 --> 20:53.090
here today?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.010
A few days ago,

20:54.590 --> 20:56.220
a cultivator underwent
Divine-Demon Tribulation

20:56.400 --> 20:58.250
in the South Sea.

20:58.270 --> 20:59.380
This man is said

20:59.400 --> 21:00.890
- to be called Changgeng
- Why does he

21:00.890 --> 21:02.570
- of the Ascendance Sect.
- only greet the Grandlord?

21:02.590 --> 21:04.560
- The Divine-Demon Tribulation
- That's perfectly normal.

21:04.560 --> 21:06.650
- hasn't appeared in a thousand years.
- The Elucidating Sect disciples

21:06.650 --> 21:08.620
- This one must be gifted.
- tend to be proud and aloof.

21:08.620 --> 21:11.150
- My mentor doesn't want you
- Only Aureate Immortals

21:11.420 --> 21:13.380
- to lead him astray.
- worth their time.

21:13.480 --> 21:16.220
So, I was sent to assess this man

21:16.590 --> 21:19.620
and see if he's worthy of our sect.

21:19.750 --> 21:22.420
Among all of our disciples,

21:23.240 --> 21:24.900
none goes by the name Changgeng.

21:25.680 --> 21:27.570
It must be rumors getting
twisted

21:27.590 --> 21:28.700
along the way.

21:30.920 --> 21:31.700
Detached Master,

21:32.030 --> 21:33.530
don't waste your tricks on me.

21:34.030 --> 21:36.810
Your sect produces a talent like this
once in a thousand years.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.180
You're afraid I'll poach him,

21:38.200 --> 21:39.730
so you hid him,

21:40.000 --> 21:40.770
right?

21:41.400 --> 21:42.810
- We...
- Enough.

21:43.200 --> 21:44.530
Since you've chosen to deceive me,

21:44.550 --> 21:46.420
you think I'd still believe you?

21:46.960 --> 21:49.380
You can't hide him forever.

21:49.400 --> 21:50.620
If I can't find Changgeng,

21:50.680 --> 21:52.770
I'll just stay here.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.810
Go, prepare a good room for me.

21:54.830 --> 21:56.010
It must be clean.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.980
If there's even a speck of dust,

21:58.000 --> 21:59.810
I'll report to my mentor

22:00.030 --> 22:03.090
that you slighted
an Elucidating Aureate Immortal

22:03.270 --> 22:06.530
and have your sect shut down.

22:12.590 --> 22:14.900
Arrange a clean room for the cultivator.

22:15.480 --> 22:17.290
Grandlord isn't even angry?

22:17.440 --> 22:19.380
He's not even spitting blood?

22:19.400 --> 22:20.180
Exactly.

22:21.550 --> 22:24.090
Westdawn Sect has already acted.

22:24.550 --> 22:27.050
The situation looks a bit troublesome.

22:27.200 --> 22:28.290
But don't worry.

22:28.750 --> 22:30.530
I still have a backup plan.

22:30.550 --> 22:31.660
A backup plan?

22:32.110 --> 22:33.330
In this world of cultivation,

22:33.510 --> 22:36.810
there are Three Sects:
Human, Elucidating, and Seizing.

22:37.400 --> 22:39.380
Since the Human
and Elucidating Sects won't work,

22:39.440 --> 22:41.330
I just need to direct it

22:41.550 --> 22:42.980
toward the Seizing Sect.

22:43.200 --> 22:43.980
Senior.

22:45.030 --> 22:45.770
What is it?

22:45.790 --> 22:48.220
Zhao Gongming
of the Seizing Sect is here.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.490
Mentor wants us.

22:49.750 --> 22:50.810
The Seizing Sect?

22:53.240 --> 22:54.660
Got it. Go on ahead.

22:54.680 --> 22:55.380
Sure!

23:00.960 --> 23:01.770
I'll hang up now.

23:03.310 --> 23:03.900
It's sour.

23:04.750 --> 23:05.530
It tastes pretty good.

23:06.400 --> 23:06.980
Do you want some?

23:10.200 --> 23:11.090
The Seizing Sect

23:11.440 --> 23:13.700
is a lineage of Heavenreach Master.

23:14.240 --> 23:15.180
They take everyone as disciples.

23:15.200 --> 23:15.940
That means

23:15.960 --> 23:17.730
all beings can walk the immortal path.

23:17.750 --> 23:18.810
Basically everyone.

23:18.920 --> 23:19.900
Just look at them!

23:19.920 --> 23:21.010
One after another,

23:21.030 --> 23:22.570
freaks and oddballs.

23:22.590 --> 23:23.570
What a bunch of half-wits.

23:25.590 --> 23:26.570
Listen, you two.

23:26.830 --> 23:28.220
Ascendance Sect is huge.

23:28.240 --> 23:29.140
Don't go wandering off.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.290
Especially you, lass.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.490
The Grandlord is here.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.460
Grandlord.

23:38.240 --> 23:40.180
Sir,

23:40.310 --> 23:41.490
what brings you here?

23:42.400 --> 23:43.420
What was his name again?

23:43.440 --> 23:44.180
What's he called?

23:44.240 --> 23:45.180
Detached Master.

23:46.070 --> 23:46.460
Old man.

23:47.160 --> 23:47.530
You...

23:49.790 --> 23:52.570
I hear Changgeng here survived

23:52.880 --> 23:55.380
the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

23:55.720 --> 23:56.660
I came to make his acquaintance.

23:56.680 --> 23:57.980
We'll have dealings later.

23:59.000 --> 24:01.570
Among all of our disciples,

24:02.200 --> 24:03.730
there is no Changgeng here.

24:03.830 --> 24:05.380
You must be too old to remember him.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.730
He and I are of the same generation.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.810
Brat, why like an old man?

24:11.350 --> 24:11.730
You...

24:12.510 --> 24:13.290
How about this?

24:13.720 --> 24:14.730
We'll look for two days.

24:14.830 --> 24:15.620
If we find him,

24:16.200 --> 24:16.940
we'll leave.

24:16.960 --> 24:17.810
If we can't find him,

24:18.270 --> 24:19.330
we'll leave anyway.

24:19.590 --> 24:20.660
We'll stay here for two or three days.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.570
Arrange some accommodations for us.

24:22.030 --> 24:23.180
There are so many of you.

24:23.240 --> 24:24.730
So, make sure the place is big.

24:24.790 --> 24:26.290
And food and drinks.

24:26.310 --> 24:27.380
Just handle it.

24:27.790 --> 24:28.570
Everyone,

24:28.880 --> 24:31.140
let's eat and drink our fill here.

24:31.160 --> 24:31.700
Okay?

24:31.720 --> 24:33.420
Sure.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.490
About the bill after...

24:35.440 --> 24:36.660
Old man, write it down.

24:37.160 --> 24:37.940
You're paying.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.010
Let's go.

24:39.270 --> 24:39.900
Let's go.

24:44.750 --> 24:45.530
Grandlord.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.010
Grandlord.

24:48.310 --> 24:49.570
Now you know, right?

24:49.920 --> 24:50.730
Grandlord coughs blood all the time.

24:52.830 --> 24:54.380
He never gets better.

24:54.400 --> 24:55.460
Probably from anger.

24:55.480 --> 24:58.570
All disciples, attention!

24:58.680 --> 24:59.860
Zhao Gongming is a man

24:59.880 --> 25:01.460
you must never cross.

25:01.590 --> 25:03.180
Mark my words.

25:04.030 --> 25:04.420
Yes.

25:04.880 --> 25:08.380
Both the Elucidating
and Seizing Sects are here.

25:10.200 --> 25:12.180
If it were an ordinary man by now,

25:12.510 --> 25:15.010
he'd have no way out.

25:15.030 --> 25:16.220
You're a little rascal.

25:16.590 --> 25:17.700
You're no ordinary man.

25:19.480 --> 25:20.620
You understand me.

25:21.590 --> 25:23.010
Since this world is divided into...

25:25.440 --> 25:26.220
Lan Ling'e?

25:27.790 --> 25:28.660
Lan Ling'e?

25:29.000 --> 25:29.860
Lan Ling'e?

25:33.160 --> 25:34.090
Though

25:34.110 --> 25:35.290
there are Three Sects,

25:35.400 --> 25:37.900
not just Three Sects
can face the Tribulation.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.250
That's the blind spot.

25:39.270 --> 25:41.460
I just need to use it well

25:41.590 --> 25:44.570
and steer Changgeng to the East Sea.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.380
Senior.

25:56.920 --> 25:57.770
Me again.

25:58.880 --> 25:59.900
When will this end?

26:01.750 --> 26:03.140
I'm Mermaid Princess Jiang Si'er,

26:03.160 --> 26:04.620
leading the South Sea elites

26:04.640 --> 26:06.290
to greet the elders of Ascendance Sect.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.570
I heard Changgeng is here.

26:09.590 --> 26:11.420
Changgeng isn't a disciple here.

26:12.000 --> 26:13.730
Princess, look elsewhere.

26:24.200 --> 26:26.660
Please house our Mermaid Clan guests.

26:30.100 --> 26:33.340
[Hall of United Spirits]

27:00.680 --> 27:01.490
Lan Ling'e!

27:01.510 --> 27:02.290
I'm leaving.

27:03.480 --> 27:04.290
Go on, hurry.

27:04.310 --> 27:04.770
Shut it tight.

27:04.790 --> 27:05.570
Keep it blocked.

27:05.590 --> 27:06.770
Don't let anyone in.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.620
What are you doing?

27:09.640 --> 27:10.330
Mentor.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.810
Mentor, many have come outside.

27:12.830 --> 27:14.380
You must not open the gate.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.770
Yes, so many people.

27:16.160 --> 27:16.940
Nonsense.

27:17.640 --> 27:20.940
We welcome immortal affinity.

27:21.720 --> 27:22.570
If we shut our door

27:22.960 --> 27:24.420
when too many come,

27:24.590 --> 27:26.460
how do we take disciples?

27:26.920 --> 27:27.380
Open the gate.

27:27.400 --> 27:29.180
But Mentor, this...

27:29.200 --> 27:30.250
Open the gate.

27:34.200 --> 27:36.180
Deity!

27:41.400 --> 27:42.460
Deity!

27:46.070 --> 27:46.940
Close the gate.

27:50.160 --> 27:51.010
Mentor,

27:51.310 --> 27:52.530
why?

27:53.960 --> 27:54.980
At this rate,

27:55.550 --> 27:56.620
we'll be overwhelmed.

27:57.510 --> 27:58.530
Oh, no!

27:58.790 --> 28:00.140
Please don't let Mentor find out

28:00.160 --> 28:01.090
I stayed out all night.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.330
Move.

28:07.440 --> 28:08.460
Come on, have a taste.

28:10.110 --> 28:12.530
Please keep things orderly and tidy.

28:12.550 --> 28:15.460
Be sure to stay safe and keep clean.

28:15.720 --> 28:17.090
Keep it clean, alright?

28:31.790 --> 28:32.570
Beautiful, isn't it?

28:33.660 --> 28:35.700
[I Was Here]

28:47.640 --> 28:49.010
Still hungover?

28:52.880 --> 28:53.660
The Human Sect.

28:54.680 --> 28:56.050
So amateurish.

29:05.240 --> 29:05.980
Jiu.

29:07.070 --> 29:07.860
You're back.

29:10.830 --> 29:12.220
Wu, what are you up to?

29:12.240 --> 29:13.490
Such a lovely day today.

29:13.510 --> 29:14.700
I just slept in.

29:14.720 --> 29:15.900
I was about to take a stroll.

29:17.200 --> 29:19.250
You're getting better at acting.

29:19.510 --> 29:20.660
You were out

29:20.960 --> 29:22.700
drinking all night, right?

29:22.720 --> 29:23.490
Wu.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.770
You mustn't tell Mentor.

29:25.790 --> 29:27.180
Or he'll punish me again.

29:27.400 --> 29:28.570
He made me do this

29:28.590 --> 29:29.620
inside that circle

29:29.750 --> 29:30.660
and forbade me from drinking

29:30.680 --> 29:31.380
or even moving a bit.

29:31.680 --> 29:32.770
- It was terrifying.
- Alright.

29:32.790 --> 29:33.250
That man...

29:33.270 --> 29:33.810
Alright.

29:33.830 --> 29:34.380
Sit down first.

29:36.070 --> 29:37.140
Really frightening.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.420
Come on.

29:38.590 --> 29:40.380
Here, have some tea.

29:41.440 --> 29:43.050
To sober you up a bit.

29:43.200 --> 29:45.490
I knew you treat me best.

29:46.590 --> 29:48.180
Mentor is busy
with outside affairs today.

29:48.200 --> 29:49.570
He doesn't know
you weren't in your room.

29:50.790 --> 29:52.090
That's good.

29:52.400 --> 29:54.330
But your drinking causes trouble.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.860
What if you cause some serious calamity?

29:55.880 --> 29:56.770
Let alone me.

29:56.790 --> 29:58.460
Even Mentor couldn't save you.

29:58.480 --> 29:59.730
But I still have you.

29:59.750 --> 30:00.620
If not, I still have

30:00.640 --> 30:02.140
all those seniors.

30:02.270 --> 30:03.050
Jiu,

30:03.160 --> 30:03.980
no matter what,

30:04.000 --> 30:05.180
in the Ascendance Sect,

30:05.200 --> 30:06.380
you count as an elder.

30:06.590 --> 30:07.490
Since you are an elder,

30:07.510 --> 30:10.090
you should shoulder that duty.

30:10.110 --> 30:12.220
But I'm your junior.

30:12.240 --> 30:13.050
Problems like these

30:13.070 --> 30:14.530
are for my seniors to solve.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.140
As for me, I should be carefree,

30:16.160 --> 30:17.700
happy, easy, and at leisure.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.570
Don't you agree?

30:18.590 --> 30:19.090
You...

30:20.480 --> 30:22.140
I think you should go to Jade Division.

30:22.200 --> 30:23.900
Jade Division suits your temper.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.490
You really get it.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.570
Do you know how good

30:26.590 --> 30:28.420
their wine is?

30:29.680 --> 30:32.290
Those two at Jade Division...

30:33.030 --> 30:35.570
What immortal seedlings are they?

30:35.920 --> 30:37.860
As for Ling'e, she's so clever

30:37.880 --> 30:38.900
and utterly adorable.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.770
As for Changshou...

30:41.480 --> 30:43.940
That little frame looks so frail.

30:44.200 --> 30:46.180
And he cannot touch girls.

30:46.200 --> 30:47.660
He can foam at the mouth with one touch.

30:47.880 --> 30:49.530
I wonder if he's cured by now.

30:50.030 --> 30:50.980
That sounds intense.

30:52.880 --> 30:53.770
What is it, Wu?

30:55.590 --> 30:58.330
Qi Yuan called them immortal seedlings.

30:59.000 --> 30:59.980
He asked me

31:00.000 --> 31:01.380
to look after them more.

31:01.400 --> 31:02.290
No problem.

31:02.550 --> 31:04.180
If anyone dares bully those two,

31:04.200 --> 31:05.660
I'll fly over and strike with my sword.

31:05.960 --> 31:07.250
Alright, you win. Happy now?

31:07.590 --> 31:09.530
What I meant to say is

31:09.590 --> 31:11.010
I'd like to bring these two

31:11.030 --> 31:12.330
to our Griefbane Division.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.090
What do you think?

31:13.110 --> 31:14.140
I think it's a splendid idea.

31:14.160 --> 31:15.090
You fetch them,

31:15.110 --> 31:16.220
and I'll take charge
of their discipline.

31:16.240 --> 31:17.050
You? Discipline them?

31:17.070 --> 31:18.010
How ridiculous.

31:18.030 --> 31:19.050
Yes, I'll do the disciplining.

31:19.110 --> 31:20.420
And I swear,

31:21.030 --> 31:22.570
I'm not just after their wine.

31:23.200 --> 31:23.980
Speaking of wine,

31:24.000 --> 31:25.530
something just came to mind.

31:25.550 --> 31:26.180
What?

31:27.030 --> 31:28.530
To punish you, Mentor

31:28.550 --> 31:29.530
ordered someone

31:29.550 --> 31:31.570
to go to your quarters

31:32.310 --> 31:33.620
and give away all your wine.

31:35.750 --> 31:38.380
I may have sinned greatly.

31:38.400 --> 31:39.460
But it shouldn't go this far.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.180
How can he give away my wine?

31:41.350 --> 31:42.660
Mentor, you white-haired old man!

31:42.680 --> 31:44.380
- You're so mean!
- I knew you'd say that.

31:47.750 --> 31:49.140
So,

31:49.830 --> 31:50.980
I hid a jar for you.

31:51.000 --> 31:51.730
Where is it?

31:52.000 --> 31:52.530
In the backyard.

31:56.240 --> 31:58.460
That's more like it.

31:58.960 --> 31:59.730
I love you.

32:00.680 --> 32:01.980
Remember: Don't let anyone see it.

32:02.000 --> 32:03.770
Don't worry; it's fine.

32:04.680 --> 32:05.660
Let me drink!

32:07.270 --> 32:08.330
Mentor!

32:11.240 --> 32:12.220
Drinking again?

32:12.240 --> 32:13.380
It has nothing to do with me.

32:22.830 --> 32:24.980
You're too cruel, Mentor.

32:25.460 --> 32:32.260
[Quarters for the Sea Deity Sect]

32:34.200 --> 32:34.980
Everyone.

32:41.830 --> 32:43.380
Since you're not cultivators,

32:43.920 --> 32:45.090
you cannot enter Ascendance Sect.

32:45.640 --> 32:48.490
The Grandlord, understanding your quest,

32:48.680 --> 32:50.620
has specially prepared food
and water for you.

32:51.750 --> 32:52.620
One serving of food per person.

32:52.640 --> 32:53.770
Water is up ahead. Help yourselves.

32:53.790 --> 32:54.530
Great!

32:55.160 --> 32:56.490
Hand these out to everyone.

33:00.110 --> 33:02.090
So, Changgeng the Great

33:02.110 --> 33:04.490
is renowned
across the cultivation world.

33:04.830 --> 33:06.570
So many have come for his name.

33:06.960 --> 33:09.140
How did I not know before?

33:09.310 --> 33:10.770
I was a frog in a well.

33:11.000 --> 33:12.620
Of course, you knew nothing.

33:12.750 --> 33:13.900
It'd be odd if you did.

33:15.270 --> 33:16.700
Where did Senior Changshou go?

33:17.510 --> 33:20.050
He probably sought some quiet.

33:20.790 --> 33:21.770
I see.

33:22.400 --> 33:23.860
Free from outside distractions,

33:23.920 --> 33:25.420
he stays true to his heart.

33:26.030 --> 33:28.570
Senior Changshou has taught me
another lesson.

33:30.110 --> 33:31.090
Junior Ling'e.

33:31.350 --> 33:32.730
I'll return to cultivate first.

33:33.440 --> 33:33.860
Alright.

33:37.680 --> 33:38.730
Ridiculous.

33:45.640 --> 33:46.330
Today,

33:46.590 --> 33:47.810
I will tell you a story

33:47.830 --> 33:49.900
about a famous tale of our sect

33:50.790 --> 33:52.900
between the Sea Deity
and the Dragon Maiden.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.460
That day,

33:56.790 --> 33:57.620
the Sea Deity Changgeng...

33:57.960 --> 33:58.460
Changgeng?

33:58.480 --> 33:59.730
was walking upon the surface of the sea.

34:00.260 --> 34:01.010
- My senior?
- Suddenly,

34:01.260 --> 34:02.200
in the distance, there was...

34:02.200 --> 34:03.180
I won't listen! I won't listen!

34:03.240 --> 34:04.730
Senior could never be
that kind of person.

34:05.200 --> 34:05.980
Impossible!

34:06.240 --> 34:07.180
Let me tell you.

34:07.200 --> 34:11.650
That carp spirit had
a truly captivating figure.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.300
Sea Deity Changgeng

34:13.320 --> 34:14.780
was burning with desire.

34:15.000 --> 34:16.690
He tore off his clothes,

34:17.230 --> 34:20.460
revealing his muscular chest.

34:21.550 --> 34:22.740
This is not for children!

34:22.760 --> 34:23.780
I'm not listening!

34:29.840 --> 34:30.780
Absolutely impossible.

34:31.000 --> 34:32.490
Senior is nothing
but a toad in the pond.

34:32.510 --> 34:33.980
No one would ever be with him.

34:49.110 --> 34:51.780
Oh, heavens! Oh, earth!

34:51.800 --> 34:53.530
Impossible!

35:03.880 --> 35:04.650
Blood again.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.300
It's fine.

35:07.110 --> 35:07.900
I'm used to it.

35:08.070 --> 35:08.860
Mentor,

35:08.920 --> 35:10.490
if I had your cultivation,

35:10.510 --> 35:11.460
I'd be throwing up every day too.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.570
Our sect

35:17.920 --> 35:19.940
hasn't been this lively in ages.

35:22.800 --> 35:24.690
Mentor, forgive my bluntness.

35:25.070 --> 35:27.170
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

35:27.190 --> 35:28.490
The Elucidating Sect is
proud and arrogant.

35:28.510 --> 35:30.170
The Seizing Sect is in disarray.

35:31.360 --> 35:34.170
The Mermaid and Dragon Clans are linked.

35:34.190 --> 35:35.380
When they're all here,

35:35.920 --> 35:38.130
I've been busy

35:38.150 --> 35:39.940
keeping order.

35:40.590 --> 35:41.340
Exactly.

35:42.760 --> 35:44.210
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

35:44.760 --> 35:47.380
Yet we all came from one root.

35:47.800 --> 35:50.050
And the Way we seek comes from one line.

35:51.150 --> 35:53.690
Why must we fight each other?

35:55.920 --> 35:57.690
I have a dream.

35:59.000 --> 36:00.260
One day,

36:00.630 --> 36:03.490
the Three Sects will drop their rifts

36:04.110 --> 36:05.170
and gather under one roof

36:05.590 --> 36:06.780
to cultivate the Way together.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.570
We'll even

36:08.480 --> 36:10.090
be united.

36:13.920 --> 36:15.090
That

36:16.590 --> 36:17.570
would be good,

36:18.000 --> 36:18.740
but

36:19.670 --> 36:20.420
is it possible?

36:22.030 --> 36:23.860
This is my dream,

36:24.590 --> 36:25.570
yet all this time,

36:26.280 --> 36:27.610
I've been at a loss.

36:28.800 --> 36:29.610
But now,

36:30.590 --> 36:31.940
I see hope.

36:33.840 --> 36:36.780
For the Three Sects
to put aside old grudges,

36:38.000 --> 36:40.170
they must face a common enemy.

36:41.880 --> 36:43.130
A common enemy?

36:43.440 --> 36:43.980
I...

36:46.840 --> 36:48.170
Your cultivation is too weak

36:48.190 --> 36:49.900
to tell from the divination.

36:50.510 --> 36:51.570
I don't blame you.

36:54.630 --> 36:57.300
Our sect has a destined fate.

36:58.110 --> 36:59.490
A thousand years after its founding,

37:00.400 --> 37:01.610
it will face a great calamity.

37:01.630 --> 37:02.460
A great calamity?

37:02.800 --> 37:03.380
What?

37:05.150 --> 37:06.690
Since the founding of our sect,

37:06.920 --> 37:08.300
it has been exactly a thousand years.

37:09.800 --> 37:10.780
It's all right.

37:13.630 --> 37:15.050
When the great calamity comes,

37:15.110 --> 37:17.050
it will be hard for us

37:17.800 --> 37:19.420
to get through it alone.

37:19.710 --> 37:20.570
So, I had to let

37:20.590 --> 37:22.900
so many stay here.

37:23.840 --> 37:25.780
Someone faced Tribulation
in the South Sea.

37:26.110 --> 37:27.300
Why did everyone

37:27.630 --> 37:29.780
end up here?

37:30.150 --> 37:31.130
Don't you think

37:31.920 --> 37:34.690
someone is setting this up?

37:36.360 --> 37:36.820
Then,

37:37.320 --> 37:38.490
do you mean

37:39.030 --> 37:41.380
someone means harm to us?

37:43.590 --> 37:44.780
I can sense a new force

37:45.230 --> 37:47.530
rising beyond our walls,

37:48.760 --> 37:51.050
though I don't know which force it is

37:51.440 --> 37:53.170
or why it targets us.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.650
But when the great calamity comes,

37:55.670 --> 37:57.170
faced with a fatal peril,

37:58.000 --> 38:00.650
I believe all the people present

38:01.230 --> 38:02.860
can surely set aside past differences

38:03.150 --> 38:04.380
and unite against the enemy.

38:04.920 --> 38:07.690
I'll use our destined calamity

38:08.360 --> 38:11.260
as the start of Three Sects' unity.

38:14.400 --> 38:15.170
Mentor,

38:16.400 --> 38:17.860
thanks for your guidance.

38:20.280 --> 38:21.690
Come on, it's your turn.

38:21.960 --> 38:22.740
My turn.

38:27.230 --> 38:28.260
Ready?

38:28.760 --> 38:29.740
Ready.

38:34.550 --> 38:35.260
Let's go.

38:46.920 --> 38:47.780
Sir.

38:48.230 --> 38:48.980
What's wrong?

38:49.070 --> 38:49.820
Nothing.

38:50.510 --> 38:51.460
Good, then.

38:52.840 --> 38:53.650
Wang Qi?

38:57.760 --> 39:00.130
There are many Wang Qis here.

39:06.800 --> 39:08.090
Sir,

39:08.400 --> 39:09.740
which Wang Qi are you looking for?

39:09.760 --> 39:11.570
I'm looking for Wang Qi
in Spiritkin Division.

39:11.920 --> 39:13.170
Wang Qi from Spiritkin Division?

39:15.590 --> 39:16.420
Is it accurate?

39:18.030 --> 39:19.170
Yes.

39:26.590 --> 39:27.570
Liu Sizhe.

39:32.400 --> 39:34.210
Sir, what brings you here?

39:34.840 --> 39:36.010
You are Liu Sizhe, right?

39:37.070 --> 39:38.010
Yes.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.300
Please bestow your guidance.

39:41.400 --> 39:42.530
Guidance is not mine to bestow.

39:42.630 --> 39:44.460
But if you insist, it's fine.

39:44.630 --> 39:45.860
Then I'll bestow first.

39:45.880 --> 39:46.900
After that, you can call.

39:47.590 --> 39:48.050
Bestowed.

39:48.190 --> 39:48.650
Call!

39:56.000 --> 39:56.860
Seniors.

39:57.070 --> 39:58.260
What are you doing here?

39:59.800 --> 40:00.690
Junior.

40:02.000 --> 40:02.820
Junior.

40:06.670 --> 40:09.130
Zhao Gongming, he's not human.

40:09.630 --> 40:10.940
What happened?

40:12.800 --> 40:14.340
Oh, right, Junior.

40:14.400 --> 40:15.980
Hurry to Jade Division! Save them!

40:28.630 --> 40:29.980
I'm here!

40:30.510 --> 40:31.780
Are you all waiting for me?

40:32.670 --> 40:33.490
Next.

40:34.550 --> 40:36.260
Li Changshou of Jade Division.

40:40.070 --> 40:41.130
Elucidating Sect.

40:41.840 --> 40:42.650
Seizing Sect.

40:43.510 --> 40:44.530
Mermaid Clan.

40:45.360 --> 40:46.380
Bear Stockade.

40:49.110 --> 40:50.980
Westdawn Sect's goal is clear.

40:51.320 --> 40:52.490
It's Changgeng.

40:53.840 --> 40:55.490
You still won't heed my plan.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.130
Yunxiao.

40:58.280 --> 40:59.050
Don't worry.

40:59.150 --> 41:00.420
I won't force you.

41:01.550 --> 41:02.460
I trust you.

41:02.710 --> 41:03.820
You have your own plan.

41:04.590 --> 41:05.570
Thank you, Yunxiao.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.650
But you also promised me

41:08.150 --> 41:10.420
that you'd tell me every plan.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.780
I'm waiting for someone.

41:15.230 --> 41:16.010
Waiting for someone?

41:16.630 --> 41:18.300
To break Westdawn Sect's plot,

41:18.480 --> 41:19.420
the safest plan

41:19.440 --> 41:21.090
is still to send the Dragon Clan up

41:21.760 --> 41:23.650
and let the Celestial Court step in.

41:23.760 --> 41:26.420
But the key figure

41:26.670 --> 41:27.740
is Ao Yi.

41:28.320 --> 41:29.610
Yet the one he wants most to see

41:29.960 --> 41:31.380
is Changgeng.

41:31.960 --> 41:32.940
I see.

41:33.440 --> 41:34.490
So, Westdawn Sect spread the rumor

41:34.510 --> 41:36.090
that Changgeng was at Ascendance Sect.

41:36.110 --> 41:37.170
And it worked in your favor.

41:37.360 --> 41:39.210
You used it to bring Ao Yi here
to Ascendance Sect.

41:40.920 --> 41:42.050
Once he shows up,

41:42.400 --> 41:43.980
I'll let him be

41:44.000 --> 41:45.610
the Tribulation bearer

41:45.630 --> 41:46.490
and help him build his name

41:46.550 --> 41:47.740
to lead the Dragon Clan.

41:48.110 --> 41:49.570
Then, he can go back
to the Dragon Palace

41:49.590 --> 41:50.900
to take the throne

41:51.230 --> 41:52.340
and, in turn, root out

41:52.360 --> 41:54.340
the Westdawn members hidden there.

41:54.360 --> 41:55.690
Yunxiao, you are truly wise.

41:55.840 --> 41:56.860
You saw through it at once.

41:58.190 --> 41:59.530
So, that's your plan.

42:00.320 --> 42:01.940
Very well, I'll help you.

42:02.000 --> 42:03.050
Thank you, Yunxiao.

42:04.190 --> 42:04.980
For now,

42:05.110 --> 42:06.610
I only need to stay quiet

42:06.630 --> 42:08.340
here in Jade Division

42:08.400 --> 42:10.530
and wait for Ao Yi to show up.

42:10.960 --> 42:12.130
But aren't you worried

42:12.760 --> 42:14.420
that Westdawn Sect will find you first?

42:15.150 --> 42:16.130
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

42:16.400 --> 42:17.860
I've made thorough preparations.

42:17.880 --> 42:19.260
I've withdrawn all paper butterflies.

42:19.280 --> 42:21.420
Even if Westdawn Sect has immense power,

42:21.670 --> 42:23.820
they'll never discover my location.

43:01.320 --> 43:07.100
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

43:07.770 --> 43:14.470
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

43:16.000 --> 43:22.050
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

43:22.680 --> 43:29.130
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

43:29.870 --> 43:36.990
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:37.370 --> 43:44.270
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:44.650 --> 43:52.000
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:52.000 --> 43:59.170
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

44:15.310 --> 44:20.480
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

44:21.570 --> 44:28.590
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

44:29.780 --> 44:35.720
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

44:36.420 --> 44:43.500
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:43.840 --> 44:50.950
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:51.270 --> 44:57.750
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:58.530 --> 45:05.740
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

45:06.130 --> 45:13.950
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
